stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> idle
    idle --> hello : Connect
    hello --> sent : Send
    hello --> idle : Retire or Disconnect
    hello --> oneshot : Fallback
    sent --> idle : Disconnect or Crash
    sent --> idle : RefuseDraining
    sent --> replied : Finish or AnswerDone
    sent --> unknown : AnswerUnknown
    idle --> oneshot : Fallback
    oneshot --> oneshotRunning : OneShotBegin
    oneshotRunning --> finished : OneShotEnd
    idle --> inspect : InspectWithoutService
    unknown --> inspect : StartInspect
    inspect --> finished : Inspect
    replied --> finished : Report
    finished --> [*]
    note right of hello
        Retire only for another build.
        Send only to the same build.
        Fallback only when unsure = 0.
    end note
    note right of sent
        INV AtMostOnce. A resend keeps
        the intent id, on a new
        connection; a reply comes
        only on its own connection.
    end note
    note right of inspect
        Entry from idle needs unsure > 0
        and service.lock free at entry.
        Started, not complete: unknown.
    end note
    class sent live
    class unknown wait
    class inspect wait
    class finished ok
